hunk_id>]，不得编造或复用不存在的 ID。\n4. 指南原文未覆盖的内容不得补写；若问题只被部分覆盖，先完整回答有证据支撑的部分，最后单列“证据未覆盖：…”。\n\n二、输出结构（必须遵守）\n### 1) 结论\n先给 2–4 句总体结论，再按“适合强化治疗 / 不适合强化治疗 / 复发难治 / 特殊人群”等维度展开，给出具体方案、药物、剂量、疗程与关键疗效数据；每个要点后标注 [ID:…]。能用表格时优先用表格，避免笼统概括。\n### 2) 依据的图谱路径\n逐条列出：起点 -[关系]-> 终点。说明这些路径支持了什么、不支持什么；若图谱未提供可用路径或缺少关键边，明确写“图谱未提供可用路径”或“图谱缺失：…”，并声明不据此推导治疗。\n### 3) 引用的指南原文\n按要点逐条摘录关键原文（英文原文保留），每条标注 [ID:<chunk_id>]，并注明来源文档与章节（如可得）。\n\n三、写作要求\n- 用中文回答，术语可保留英文缩写。\n- 剂量、年龄范围、疗程必须与原文一致，不得外推或改写。\n- 不评价提问或证据本身，不输出“您的回答/以下是对…的系统性回答”等元叙述。\n- 篇幅以证据充分度为限：证据充分则详实，证据不足则简短并明确说明。","temperature":0.1,"temperatureEnabled":true,"tool_timeout":10,"tools":[],"topPEnabled":true,"top_p":0.3,"user_prompt":"","visual_files_var":""}},"upstream":["Invoke:ShortStampsShare","Retrieval:FluffyCoinsMatter"]},"Agent:QuietBugsAccept":{"downstream":["Retrieval:FluffyCoinsMatter","StringTransform:ChattyNailsVisit"],"obj":{"component_name":"Agent","params":{"cite":true,"delay_after_error":1,"description":"","exception_default_value":"","exception_goto":[],"exception_method":"","frequencyPenaltyEnabled":true,"frequency_penalty":0.7,"llm_id":"1a467ebc0df742e5961aff478759a048","maxTokensEnabled":false,"max_retries":3,"max_rounds":1,"max_tokens":256,"mcp":[],"message_history_window_size":12,"outputs":{"content":{"type":"string","value":""}},"presencePenaltyEnabled":true,"presence_penalty":0.4,"prompts":[{"content":"{sys.query}\n{Agent:AfraidSpidersOccur@content}","role":"user"}],"showStructuredOutput":false,"sys_prompt":"你是医学检索词生成器。结合病种与问题，输出一句用于检索中文诊疗指南的检索词（不超过20字），只输出检索词本身。","temperature":0.1,"temperatureEnabled":true,"tool_timeout":10,"tools":[],"topPEnabled":true,"top_p":0.3,"user_prompt":"","visual_files_var":""}},"upstream":["Agent:AfraidSpidersOccur"]},"Invoke:ShortStampsShare":{"downstream":["Agent:KhakiPoetsSend"],"obj":{"component_name":"Invoke","params":{"clean_html":false,"headers":"{\"Content-Type\":\"application/json\"}","method":"POST","outputs":{"result":{"type":"string","value":""}},"proxy":"","timeout":30,"url":"http:/